# Meet Our Team

Our staff team is dedicated to the mission of challenging individuals to know and mature in Christ. It is a joy to serve alongside people who have been called to Camp Otyokwah to make a lasting difference in the lives of every camper and guest.

---

{% twoColumns reverseOnMobile=false %}
## Monty and Janette Harlan - Executive Director

Monty has been Director at Camp Otyokwah since 2019 and the Director of our sister camp, Bear Lake Camp since 1992. During his tenure of leadership of directing, Monty has seen God strengthening the impact of this ministry by expanding our summer camping program to 6 weeks, implementing the Summer Staff and Service Crew program, cabin renovations and other construction and renovations to the facilities, and the birth of a vibrant community ministry. He can’t wait to see what God is going to do next and see more lives impacted for the Kingdom through the ministry at Otyokwah.\
Monty, an ordained minister, holds a B.A. from Taylor University and an M.Div. from Winebrenner Theological Seminary. Monty has been married to his wife Janette for over 30 years. Janette is very active in the camping, retreat, and community ministries at Otyokwah. Together they have have four children and are all married: Ben and his wife Karli, Abbey and her husband Jake, Rebekah and her husband Connor, and Caleb and his wife Rachel.

**Email:** [monty@otyokwah.org](mailto:monty@otyokwah.org)

