{% twoColumns reverseOnMobile=true %}
## Connor Miller - Director of Operations

## Rebekah Miller - Office administrator

Connor and Rebekah came on full-time at Otyokwah in 2021. After meeting at Bethel University, they got married in 2017. Both Connor and Rebekah are familiar and very knowledgeable about camp after growing up there. Before coming to camp, Connor started his own business and Rebekah was an elementary school teacher. Connor's leadership and craftsmanship makes him responsible for all the facilities and grounds at Otyokwah. Rebekah is also apart of the leadership team and facilitates management due to her focus and attention to detail. Connor graduated with a B.A. in Business and Rebekah graduated with a B.A. in Elementary Education from Bethel University in 2015. They have two girls, Eden and Esther.

**Email:** [connor@otyokwah.org](mailto:connor@otyokwah.org)

**Email:** [rebekah@otyokwah.org](mailto:rebekah@otyokwah.org)

