## Jennifer Sherbahn - Program Director

Jennifer came to Otyokwah in the summer of 2024. She joins our team after spending several years at our sister camp, Bear Lake Camp. With her role in programming, she coordinates a large portion of the summer program in conjunction with our resident staff. She loves all things outdoors, especially hiking and backpacking. Jennifer graduated from Anderson University with a B.A. in Youth Ministry, Education, and Non Profit Leadership in 2014.

**Email:** [jennifer@otyokwah.org](mailto:jennifer@otyokwah.org)

